== A method argument is analyzed against its parameter type, like a routine
== argument: a decimal literal passed to a Currency parameter is a Currency.
Type
    TWallet Struct
        FBalance Currency := 0.00
    ;

TWallet.Deposit(Self mut, Amount Currency) :
    Self.FBalance += Amount
;

Main :
    W TWallet
    W.Deposit(500.00)
    W.Deposit(0.25)
    PutLn(W.FBalance)
;
